# API

- Consistent response envelope: `{ success, data|error, meta }`.
- Typed error codes (`VALIDATION_ERROR`, `INSUFFICIENT_STOCK`, etc.).
- Validate every request with Zod from `packages/validators`.
- Version external APIs (`/api/v1/...`); Server Actions stay private/unversioned.
- Same services for Route Handlers and Server Actions — no duplicated rules.
- See `docs/api.md`.
